  "summary": "Studies directly applying representation learning with paired positive and negative examples to agricultural yield estimation report varied performance across different datasets. Brennan et al. (2018) achieve an F1 score of 0.83 on ToxiBench [V0048], while Adebayo et al. (2026) report an AUROC of 0.76 on CellLife [V0047]. Haddad et al. (2025) document a test MAE of 0.69 using LedgerGuard [V0046], and Gupta et al. (2024) report an accuracy of 0.62 on AgriSat-4 [V0045].",
